---
import Layout from '../components/Layout.astro';

const lastUpdated = '17 May 2026';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | BBTea.sg"
  description="Privacy Policy for BBTea.sg — Singapore's bubble tea directory. Learn how we collect, use, and protect your information."
  canonical="https://bbtea.sg/privacy/"
>

  <section class="bg-white border-b border-[var(--color-stone-200)] py-12">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <nav class="text-sm text-[var(--color-stone-400)] flex items-center gap-1.5 mb-6" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="/" class="hover:text-[var(--color-stone-900)] transition-colors">Home</a>
        <span>/</span>
        <span class="text-[var(--color-stone-700)] font-medium">Privacy Policy</span>
      </nav>
      <h1 class="text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-display font-bold leading-tight mb-3">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-stone-400)]">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-14">
    <div class="prose-content space-y-10 text-[var(--color-stone-600)] leading-relaxed">

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-display font-bold text-[var(--color-stone-900)]">1. Introduction</h2>
        <p>
          BBTea.sg ("we", "us", or "our") operates as a free, editorial directory of bubble tea shops in Singapore. This Privacy Policy explains what information we collect when you visit <strong>bbtea.sg</strong>, how we use it, and your rights under the Singapore Personal Data Protection Act 2012 (PDPA).
        </p>
        <p>
          By using BBTea.sg, you agree to the practices described in this policy.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-display font-bold text-[var(--color-stone-900)]">2. Information We Collect</h2>
        <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-[var(--color-stone-800)]">2.1 Information You Provide</h3>
        <p>
          BBTea.sg does not require you to create an account to browse the directory. If you submit an advertiser inquiry form, we may collect the contact and campaign information you provide, such as your name, company, email address, phone number, website or social link, budget range, campaign goal, preferred start date, and message.
        </p>
        <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-[var(--color-stone-800)]">2.2 Information Collected Automatically</h3>
        <p>When you visit our website, analytics tools and our hosting provider may automatically collect:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1.5">
          <li>Pages viewed and time spent on each page</li>
          <li>Referring website or search query that brought you here</li>
          <li>Browser type, operating system, and device type</li>
          <li>General geographic location (country/city level, derived from IP address)</li>
          <li>IP address (anonymised where possible)</li>
          <li>Clicks on outbound links (e.g. links to brand websites or map services)</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          This data is aggregated and used only to understand how visitors use the site so we can improve it. We do not build individual profiles of visitors.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-display font-bold text-[var(--color-stone-900)]">3. Cookies and Tracking</h2>
        <p>We use the following third-party services that may set cookies or collect usage data:</p>
        <div class="overflow-x-auto">
          <table class="w-full text-sm border-collapse">
            <thead>
              <tr class="border-b border-[var(--color-stone-200)]">
                <th class="text-left py-2 pr-4 font-semibold text-[var(--color-stone-800)]">Service</th>
                <th class="text-left py-2 pr-4 font-semibold text-[var(--color-stone-800)]">Purpose</th>
                <th class="text-left py-2 font-semibold text-[var(--color-stone-800)]">Provider</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody class="divide-y divide-[var(--color-stone-200)]">
              <tr>
                <td class="py-2.5 pr-4 font-medium text-[var(--color-stone-700)]">Google Tag Manager</td>
                <td class="py-2.5 pr-4">Manages analytics tags</td>
                <td class="py-2.5">Google LLC</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="py-2.5 pr-4 font-medium text-[var(--color-stone-700)]">Google Analytics</td>
                <td class="py-2.5 pr-4">Aggregated visitor statistics</td>
                <td class="py-2.5">Google LLC</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="py-2.5 pr-4 font-medium text-[var(--color-stone-700)]">Cloudflare</td>
                <td class="py-2.5 pr-4">Hosting, CDN, and security</td>
                <td class="py-2.5">Cloudflare, Inc.</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
        <p>
          You can opt out of Google Analytics by installing the <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" class="text-[var(--color-forest-700)] underline hover:text-[var(--color-forest-800)] transition-colors" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Analytics Opt-out Browser Add-on</a>. Most browsers also allow you to block or delete cookies via their settings.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-display font-bold text-[var(--color-stone-900)]">4. How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <p>The data collected is used solely to:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1.5">
          <li>Understand which pages and features are most useful to visitors</li>
          <li>Identify and fix technical errors</li>
          <li>Improve the directory's content and navigation</li>
          <li>Respond to advertiser inquiries and assess potential commercial partnerships</li>
        </ul>
        <p>We do not sell, rent, or share your personal information with third parties for marketing purposes.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-display font-bold text-[var(--color-stone-900)]">5. Third-Party Links</h2>
        <p>
          BBTea.sg links to external websites (brand homepages, Google Maps, food delivery apps). Once you leave our site, this Privacy Policy no longer applies. We encourage you to read the privacy policies of any third-party websites you visit.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-display font-bold text-[var(--color-stone-900)]">6. Directory Listings Data</h2>
        <p>
          Information about bubble tea brands and outlets displayed on BBTea.sg is sourced from publicly available information, including brand websites, social media, and our own editorial research. We do not publish personal data about private individuals.
        </p>
        <p>
          If you are a brand representative and believe information about your business is inaccurate or should be removed, please contact us at the address below.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-display font-bold text-[var(--color-stone-900)]">7. Data Retention</h2>
        <p>
          Aggregated analytics data is retained in accordance with Google Analytics' default retention settings (up to 26 months). Advertiser inquiry details may be retained for as long as needed to respond to the inquiry, manage potential partnerships, and maintain business records. We do not store personal data on our own servers beyond what our hosting provider (Cloudflare) logs for security and performance purposes.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-display font-bold text-[var(--color-stone-900)]">8. Your Rights (PDPA)</h2>
        <p>Under Singapore's Personal Data Protection Act 2012, you have the right to:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1.5">
          <li>Request access to personal data we hold about you</li>
          <li>Request correction of inaccurate personal data</li>
          <li>Withdraw consent to the collection or use of your personal data</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          Given the nature of our site, we are unlikely to hold identifiable personal data about general directory visitors. If you submit an advertiser inquiry, we may hold the information you provided. To exercise any of these rights, contact us at the address in Section 10.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-display font-bold text-[var(--color-stone-900)]">9. Children's Privacy</h2>
        <p>
          BBTea.sg is a general-audience directory and is not directed at children under 13. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-display font-bold text-[var(--color-stone-900)]">10. Contact Us</h2>
        <p>
          If you have questions about this Privacy Policy or wish to exercise your data rights, you can reach us at:
        </p>
        <div class="bg-[var(--color-cream-100)] rounded-lg p-5 text-sm space-y-1">
          <p class="font-semibold text-[var(--color-stone-800)]">BBTea.sg</p>
          <p>Singapore</p>
          <p>
            Email: <a href="mailto:hello@bbtea.sg" class="text-[var(--color-forest-700)] underline hover:text-[var(--color-forest-800)] transition-colors">hello@bbtea.sg</a>
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-display font-bold text-[var(--color-stone-900)]">11. Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p>
          We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Changes will be reflected by the "Last updated" date at the top of this page. Continued use of BBTea.sg after changes constitutes acceptance of the updated policy.
        </p>
      </section>

    </div>
  </div>

</Layout>
